Changes
=======

v4.0.0 19 Apr 2026
  * First stable v4 release. Tracks github.com/lestrrat-go/jwx/v4 v4.0.0.

v4.0.0-alpha3 14 Apr 2026
  * Adopt jwk/ecdsa.PointValidator from jwx v4.0.0-scratch.19. Point
    validation now uses secp256k1.ParsePubKey, replacing the upstream
    fallback to the deprecated elliptic.Curve.IsOnCurve method.
  * Panic on Register* errors during init() for fail-loud registration.
  * Document ES256K signature malleability (low-S) status.

v4.0.0-alpha2 13 Apr 2026
  * Compatibility release for jwx/v4 v4.0.0-scratch.15. No code changes.

v4.0.0-alpha1 8 Apr 2026
  * Initial version, ES256K (secp256k1) support for github.com/lestrrat-go/jwx/v4.
